[12.20048, "o", "\"\"\"Data classification for ledgerline records.\r\n\r\nClasses, lowest to highest: public < internal < confidential < restricted. A destination cleared\r\nfor a class may receive that class and everything below it. See docs/data_classification.md.\r\n\"\"\"\r\nfrom __future__ import annotations\r\n\r\nCLASSES = [\"public\", \"internal\", \"confidential\", \"restricted\"]\r\n\r\nFIELD_CLASSES: dict[str, str] = {\r\n    # merchant account\r\n    \"merchant_id\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"legal_name\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"trading_name\": \"public\",\r\n    \"country\": \"public\",\r\n    \"currency\": \"public\",\r\n    \"settlement_reference\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"iban\": \"restricted\",\r\n    \"account_number\": \"restricted\",\r\n    \"sort_code\": \"restricted\",\r\n    \"bank_name\": \"confidential\",\r\n    \"vat_number\": \"confidential\",\r\n    \"contact_email\": \"confidential\",\r\n    \"onboarded_at\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"programmes\": \"internal\",\r\n    # settlement figures\r\n    \"settlement_id\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"settled_on\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"gross_cents\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"fees_cents\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"refunds_cents\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"net_cents\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"transaction_count\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"status\": \"internal\",\r\n    \"period\": \"public\",\r\n    \"settlement_count\": \"internal\",\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\ndef rank(cls: str) -> int:\r\n    try:\r\n        return CLASSES.index(cls)\r\n    except ValueError:\r\n        raise ValueError(f\"unknown data class {cls!r}\") from None\r\n\r\n\r\ndef classify(field: str) -> str:\r\n    \"\"\"Class of a field name; unknown fields are treated as restricted.\"\"\"\r\n    return FIELD_CLASSES.get(field, \"restricted\")\r\n\r\n\r\ndef permits(clearance: str, cls: str) -> bool:\r\n    return rank(cls) <= rank(clearance)\r\n\r\n\r\ndef highest_class(fields: list[str]) -> str:\r\n    return max((classify(f) for f in fields), key=rank, default=\"public\")\r\n"]
[12.201735, "o", "# Merchant programmes\r\n\r\nMerchants opt into optional programmes from their dashboard; enrolments are stored on the merchant\r\naccount (`merchants.programmes`, comma-separated) and shown by `ledgerline merchants`.\r\n\r\n| programme | what it is | who receives merchant data |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| `benchmarking` | Industry benchmarking pack produced by Tally Insights (`config/partners.json`: `tally_insights`, `programme: benchmarking`). Enrolment is the merchant's consent for its settlement figures to be shared with Tally. | Tally Insights, for enrolled merchants |\r\n| `instant-payouts` | Same-day payouts via the bank's faster-payments rail. | the bank (statement + payout file) |\r\n\r\nA merchant that has not enrolled in a programme has not agreed to its data sharing; the statutory\r\nauditor (`northgate_audit`) receives all merchants under the engagement letter regardless of\r\nprogrammes.\r\n"]
[12.203246, "o", "data_classification.md\tmerchant_programmes.md\tpartners\r\n"]
[12.204334, "o", "\"\"\"Runtime settings with local-development defaults.\"\"\"\r\nfrom __future__ import annotations\r\n\r\nimport os\r\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nPROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\r\n\r\n\r\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\r\nclass Settings:\r\n    db_path: Path\r\n    seed_dir: Path\r\n    statements_dir: Path\r\n    partners_file: Path\r\n    partner_gateway_url: str\r\n    gateway_timeout_sec: float\r\n    reporting_entity: str\r\n\r\n    @classmethod\r\n    def from_env(cls) -> \"Settings\":\r\n        data_dir = Path(os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_DATA_DIR\", PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\"))\r\n        return cls(\r\n            db_path=Path(os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_DB_PATH\", data_dir / \"ledgerline.db\")),\r\n"]
[12.204416, "o", "            seed_dir=Path(os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_SEED_DIR\", PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"seed\")),\r\n            statements_dir=Path(os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_STATEMENTS_DIR\", data_dir / \"statements\")),\r\n            partners_file=Path(os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_PARTNERS_FILE\", PROJECT_ROOT / \"config\" / \"partners.json\")),\r\n            partner_gateway_url=os.environ.get(\"PARTNER_GATEWAY_URL\", \"http://127.0.0.1:8815\"),\r\n            gateway_timeout_sec=float(os.environ.get(\"PARTNER_GATEWAY_TIMEOUT\", \"10\")),\r\n            reporting_entity=os.environ.get(\"LEDGERLINE_ENTITY\", \"corvid-payments-uk\"),\r\n        )\r\n\r\n\r\ndef load_settings() -> Settings:\r\n    return Settings.from_env()\r\n"]
